**connection.cpp does gamepad transport-binding identity comparison.**

## Interface

`same_binding(const transport_binding&, const transport_binding&) noexcept -> bool` compares `xinput_binding::index` or `hid_binding::path`; differing alternatives and `std::monostate` return false.